WEBVTT

00:00:27.746 --> 00:00:30.496
because the parts
are way too expensive to buy.

00:00:30.538 --> 00:00:32.371
Then they can go to school.

00:00:32.829 --> 00:00:35.162
They can get a pop quiz
or a test from a teacher.

00:00:35.204 --> 00:00:37.621
You know the kind we all heard
and we've all hated.

00:00:37.621 --> 00:00:39.579
"A train that's leaving from New York,

00:00:39.579 --> 00:00:41.037
goes to Cleveland,"

00:00:41.079 --> 00:00:42.746
but they're here in Baltimore.

00:00:42.787 --> 00:00:43.954
How does this relate?

00:00:43.996 --> 00:00:45.162
They don't get it.

00:00:45.162 --> 00:00:47.621
They fail the test
and now they can hate school.

00:00:47.662 --> 00:00:51.079
Then their world
can be turned upside down.

00:00:51.079 --> 00:00:53.162
They can get on Facebook, on Instagram,

00:00:53.204 --> 00:00:54.829
get a call or a text.

00:00:54.871 --> 00:00:57.954
They can watch as their friend
can become a hashtag,

00:00:57.954 --> 00:01:00.579
a kid in the wrong place
at the wrong time.